Imagine that you are doing a project on what kinds of books teenagers in Zetland prefer. You have found some data on the subject, the results of an opinion poll:

Kind of books: share of teenagers (%)
Fantasy: 35
Detective stories: 24
Science fiction: 19
Classics: 13
Poetry: 9

Comment on the data and give your opinion on the subject of the project. Write 200-250 words. Use the following plan:
- make an opening statement on the subject of the project;
- select and report 2-3 facts;
- make 1-2 comparisons where relevant and give your comments;
- outline a problem that can arise with reading books and suggest a way of solving it;
- conclude by giving and explaining your opinion on the subject.

